1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:00,820
Why don't we just

2
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:02,980
stop lava with a fire hose?

3
00:00:03,060 --> 00:00:04,540
Water turns lava into rock,

4
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:05,300
right?

5
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:06,660
But firefighters in Hawaii

6
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:07,380
tried it,

7
00:00:07,420 --> 00:00:09,300
and the lava kept coming.

8
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:11,220
There was too much lava.

9
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:12,340
So when lava crept

10
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:14,420
toward Iceland's top fishing port,

11
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:16,500
they pumped the ocean onto it.

12
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:18,260
For five months.

13
00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:19,060
The front froze

14
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:20,100
into a wall,

15
00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:21,540
so the lava stopped.

16
00:00:21,620 --> 00:00:22,580
And that wall still

17
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:24,420
protects the port from storms.
